  "description": "Purpose-built flamenco footwear sounded by the dancer: firm soles and small clustered nails at heel and toe provide percussive articulation. This differs physically from tap-shoe plates, wooden clogs and generic boot stomping. Register and dynamics are representative editorial coordinates, not measurements. Floor type can remain unknown.",
